{"duration_api_ms":276267,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"91c48563-ad22-4cb9-afb2-0f110bd1e585","total_cost_usd":1.3753284000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":122,"cache_creation_input_tokens":70384,"cache_read_input_tokens":4202582,"output_tokens":24294,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":8092},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":70384,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3162,"cache_read_input_tokens":87148,"cache_creation_input_tokens":260,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":260},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":10007,"outputTokens":17,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.010092,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":122,"outputTokens":24294,"cacheReadInputTokens":4202582,"cacheCreationInputTokens":70384,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.3652364000000001,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":8092,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":75,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"status\":\"completed\",\"summary\":\"Configured tc/HTB traffic shaping on node1 (OpenWrt router) to cap node2's throughput through node1 to ~1 Mbit/s in both directions (egress HTB class filtered on dst 10.100.58.11, ingress redirected via ifb0 and HTB-shaped filtered on src 10.100.58.11), while leaving node1's own traffic and node1↔node3 traffic unshaped. Persisted the shaping via /etc/tc-node2-limit.sh invoked from /etc/rc.local. Demonstrated the limit with iperf3 transfers in both directions (node2→node1 ~874-917 Kbit/s, node1→node2 ~1.11-1.14 Mbit/s) and confirmed node3↔node1 remained at ~70-75 Gbit/s unshaped. Completed the mandatory restart protocol on all three nodes one at a time: captured baseline boot IDs, issued detached (setsid) reboot commands whose acknowledgement returned before disconnection, polled until exec was available again, and proved changed boot IDs (node1 eb80a43a→a379200b, node2 225ffbf7→19b37836, node3 0d49f077→616c3e9c) plus post-restart recovery — tc shaping/config persisted and re-verified working on node1, and node2/node3 network + iperf3 connectivity recovered and re-tested.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Surveyed topology: node1 (OpenWrt 25.12.2) and node2/node3 (Ubuntu 16.04) share one /24 (10.100.58.0/24); node1's br-lan is the shaping enforcement point\",\"Installed tc-full, kmod-sched-core, kmod-ifb, iperf3 on node1 via apk; confirmed iperf3 present on node2/node3\",\"Measured unshaped baseline node2->node1 throughput (~76 Gbit/s)\",\"Created ifb0 interface and configured HTB egress shaping on br-lan (1mbit class filtered by dst=node2 IP) plus ingress redirect-to-ifb0 with HTB shaping (1mbit class filtered by src=node2 IP)\",\"Verified shaping with bidirectional iperf3 tests (node2->node1 ~0.87-0.92 Mbit/s, node1->node2 ~1.1 Mbit/s) while node1<->node3 remained at ~70-76 Gbit/s unshaped\",\"Persisted the tc configuration in /etc/tc-node2-limit.sh, invoked at boot from /etc/rc.local\",\"Captured pre-restart boot IDs/uptime baselines on all 3 nodes\",\"Restarted node1, node2, node3 sequentially (one at a time) using setsid-detached reboot so the ack returned before disconnect; polled each until exec access returned\",\"Verified changed boot IDs on all 3 nodes proving actual restarts occurred\",\"Re-verified post-restart: tc shaping config auto-restored and functional on node1, node2 shaped throughput re-measured (~1.14 Mbit/s), node3 unshaped throughput re-measured (~69.6 Gbit/s)\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Baseline unshaped throughput measurement before shaping\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-4abed0383f5d4680\"],\"summary\":\"iperf3 node2->node1 measured ~76.6 Gbit/s before any tc rules were applied\"},{\"requirement\":\"tc/HTB shaping rules correctly installed and matching node2's IP\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a8031d61c5104402\",\"cmd-c7b11290329e4304\"],\"summary\":\"HTB classes at 1mbit created on br-lan (egress) and ifb0 (ingress); tc filter output shows u32 match 0a643a0b (10.100.58.11) hex for both the dst filter on br-lan and the src filter redirecting to ifb0\"},{\"requirement\":\"Demonstrate ~1 Mbit/s limit in the node2->node1 direction\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-d3dcd2a3dcd9492c\"],\"summary\":\"iperf3 node2 client to node1 server measured 917 Kbit/s at receiver over 8s\"},{\"requirement\":\"Demonstrate ~1 Mbit/s limit in the node1->node2 direction\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-685467224f1a4572\"],\"summary\":\"iperf3 reverse-mode (node1 sending) measured 1.11 Mbit/s at node2 receiver over 8s\"},{\"requirement\":\"Traffic from node1 to other hosts (node3) stays unshaped\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-22166ce778fb4c2c\"],\"summary\":\"iperf3 node3<->node1 measured ~74.8 Gbit/s, unaffected by the node2-specific shaping rules\"},{\"requirement\":\"Shaping rules persist across reboot (config path)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-05b13116f089489a\"],\"summary\":\"Installed /etc/tc-node2-limit.sh and wired it into /etc/rc.local to run at boot\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 healthy baseline before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-aacf5228548947fd\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id eb80a43a-ba60-47f6-aedc-50de1451f9ad, uptime 6min, and live tc qdisc/class state prior to restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart acknowledgement returns before disconnect\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-7286d5c1ee164f2b\"],\"summary\":\"setsid-detached reboot command acknowledged (ack-reboot-node1) before the connection dropped\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 changed boot identity after restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-77547bfab88a41a3\"],\"summary\":\"Post-restart boot_id a379200b-7322-40c7-ab2c-929406e38c18 with uptime 0min, differing from pre-restart eb80a43a...(proves an actual reboot occurred)\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 post-restart recovery of required config/services\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-9fbf4d3633cb46ad\",\"cmd-1609189feadb4001\"],\"summary\":\"tc qdisc/class/filter state auto-restored via rc.local matches pre-restart config; live iperf3 re-test shows node2->node1 shaped to 874 Kbit/s post-restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 healthy baseline before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-9add45aa89334f00\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id 225ffbf7-477b-4e25-bbae-e26343dd98bd, uptime 7min\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart acknowledgement returns before disconnect\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-1b4489f875cd47b3\"],\"summary\":\"setsid-detached sudo reboot acknowledged (ack-reboot-node2) before disconnect\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 changed boot identity after restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a522f0f5f78d4245\"],\"summary\":\"Post-restart boot_id 19b37836-33dd-4fa1-834c-0ce44b5a9257, uptime 0min, differing from pre-restart 225ffbf7...\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 post-restart recovery and shaping still enforced\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-49f677653dd94e25\",\"cmd-513a6f466b3a4d3f\"],\"summary\":\"ens2 network interface back up with correct IP; iperf3 reverse-mode re-test shows node1->node2 still shaped to 1.14 Mbit/s\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 healthy baseline before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-55a7e777f1d64c02\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id 0d49f077-ed5b-479a-b08e-ec4392d89c52, uptime 8min\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 restart acknowledgement returns before disconnect\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-7055e3956e7742ad\"],\"summary\":\"setsid-detached sudo reboot acknowledged (ack-reboot-node3) before disconnect\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 changed boot identity after restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-062479111a4543c2\"],\"summary\":\"Post-restart boot_id 616c3e9c-0923-4e2b-aa28-95d04879a055, uptime 0min, differing from pre-restart 0d49f077...\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 post-restart recovery and unshaped traffic confirmed\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-bc4d8b73b08f45a7\",\"cmd-bfd18446842d4a82\"],\"summary\":\"ens2 back up with correct IP; iperf3 re-test node3<->node1 measured ~69.6 Gbit/s, confirming node1-node3 path remains unshaped after both nodes restarted\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured tc/HTB traffic shaping on node1 (OpenWrt router) to cap node2's throughput through node1 to ~1 Mbit/s in both directions (egress HTB class filtered on dst 10.100.58.11, ingress redirected via ifb0 and HTB-shaped filtered on src 10.100.58.11), while leaving node1's own traffic and node1↔node3 traffic unshaped. Persisted the shaping via /etc/tc-node2-limit.sh invoked from /etc/rc.local. Demonstrated the limit with iperf3 transfers in both directions (node2→node1 ~874-917 Kbit/s, node1→node2 ~1.11-1.14 Mbit/s) and confirmed node3↔node1 remained at ~70-75 Gbit/s unshaped. Completed the mandatory restart protocol on all three nodes one at a time: captured baseline boot IDs, issued detached (setsid) reboot commands whose acknowledgement returned before disconnection, polled until exec was available again, and proved changed boot IDs (node1 eb80a43a→a379200b, node2 225ffbf7→19b37836, node3 0d49f077→616c3e9c) plus post-restart recovery — tc shaping/config persisted and re-verified working on node1, and node2/node3 network + iperf3 connectivity recovered and re-tested.","actions_performed":["Surveyed topology: node1 (OpenWrt 25.12.2) and node2/node3 (Ubuntu 16.04) share one /24 (10.100.58.0/24); node1's br-lan is the shaping enforcement point","Installed tc-full, kmod-sched-core, kmod-ifb, iperf3 on node1 via apk; confirmed iperf3 present on node2/node3","Measured unshaped baseline node2->node1 throughput (~76 Gbit/s)","Created ifb0 interface and configured HTB egress shaping on br-lan (1mbit class filtered by dst=node2 IP) plus ingress redirect-to-ifb0 with HTB shaping (1mbit class filtered by src=node2 IP)","Verified shaping with bidirectional iperf3 tests (node2->node1 ~0.87-0.92 Mbit/s, node1->node2 ~1.1 Mbit/s) while node1<->node3 remained at ~70-76 Gbit/s unshaped","Persisted the tc configuration in /etc/tc-node2-limit.sh, invoked at boot from /etc/rc.local","Captured pre-restart boot IDs/uptime baselines on all 3 nodes","Restarted node1, node2, node3 sequentially (one at a time) using setsid-detached reboot so the ack returned before disconnect; polled each until exec access returned","Verified changed boot IDs on all 3 nodes proving actual restarts occurred","Re-verified post-restart: tc shaping config auto-restored and functional on node1, node2 shaped throughput re-measured (~1.14 Mbit/s), node3 unshaped throughput re-measured (~69.6 Gbit/s)"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Baseline unshaped throughput measurement before shaping","command_ids":["cmd-4abed0383f5d4680"],"summary":"iperf3 node2->node1 measured ~76.6 Gbit/s before any tc rules were applied"},{"requirement":"tc/HTB shaping rules correctly installed and matching node2's IP","command_ids":["cmd-a8031d61c5104402","cmd-c7b11290329e4304"],"summary":"HTB classes at 1mbit created on br-lan (egress) and ifb0 (ingress); tc filter output shows u32 match 0a643a0b (10.100.58.11) hex for both the dst filter on br-lan and the src filter redirecting to ifb0"},{"requirement":"Demonstrate ~1 Mbit/s limit in the node2->node1 direction","command_ids":["cmd-d3dcd2a3dcd9492c"],"summary":"iperf3 node2 client to node1 server measured 917 Kbit/s at receiver over 8s"},{"r